{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And you shall not swear.</b> Scripture wrote for you ולא תשבעו at the end, for one suspected of theft and of deposit will swear — 'you shall not steal,' and 'you shall not deny,' and 'you shall not swear'; the verse returns to it to warn the many." "<b>And you profane the Name.</b> For one who swears falsely does not regard the Name of the Holy One, blessed be He, and swears by it and falsifies."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:25.867641423Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}